      "hash": "a226f27247818ecb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a notice posted here...\\n“Be on the lookout for discarded items!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_road017_kanban_02",
      "hash": "a226f3724781907e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nAll Pokémon are unique.\\c\\nEven Pokémon of the same species and level\\ngrow at different rates...which adds up in time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_road017_kanban_03",
      "hash": "a226f47247819231",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_road017_kanban_07",
      "hash": "a226f872478198fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nWhen you’re catching Pokémon, try to throw\\nyour Poké Ball inside the colored ring!\\c\\nGet Nice Throws or Great Throws, based on\\nhow small the ring is, to make catching\\r\\nPokémon a breeze!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_road017_kanban_04",
      "hash": "a226f572478193e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Route 17\\n(Celadon City ⇄ Fuchsia City)"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_road017_kanban_05",
      "hash": "a226f67247819597",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a notice posted here...\\n“Don’t throw the game.\\r\\nThrow Poké Balls instead!”"
    },
    {
